    { "zh": "幾乎所有生物製劑與 JAK 抑制劑使用前都需：", "en": "Almost all biologics and JAK inhibitors require the following pre-treatment workup:", "tag": "p" },
    { "zh": "使用中：每 3-6 個月追蹤 CBC、肝腎、血脂，部分藥物需追蹤淋巴球、CK。", "en": "During treatment: monitor CBC, renal/hepatic function, and lipids every 3–6 months; some drugs additionally require monitoring of lymphocytes and CK.", "tag": "p" },
    { "zh": "2026 年台灣健保有條件給付的皮膚科生物製劑與小分子標靶藥（隨時更新）:", "en": "Dermatology biologics and small-molecule targeted drugs conditionally covered by Taiwan NHI as of 2026 (subject to updates):", "tag": "p" },
    { "zh": "生物製劑與小分子標靶藥物徹底改變了中重度皮膚疾病的治療面貌：", "en": "Biologics and small-molecule targeted drugs have transformed the treatment landscape for moderate-to-severe skin diseases:", "tag": "p" },
    { "zh": "疫苗狀態審視：活性疫苗使用前需間隔（MMR、水痘、Shingrix 為非活性疫苗例外可用）", "en": "Vaccination status review: live vaccines require spacing before treatment (MMR, varicella; Shingrix is non-live and is an exception)", "tag": "li" },
    { "zh": "結核篩檢：胸部 X 光（3 個月內）+ IGRA;若潛伏性 TB 須先預防性治療(Isoniazid 9 個月或 Rifampicin 4 個月)", "en": "TB screening: chest X-ray (within 3 months) + IGRA; latent TB requires prophylaxis (isoniazid 9 months or rifampicin 4 months) before initiation", "tag": "li" },
    { "zh": "B / C 型肝炎篩檢、HIV、CBC、肝腎功能、血脂(總膽固醇 / LDL / HDL / TG)、CPK", "en": "HBV/HCV serology, HIV, CBC, hepatic and renal function, lipid panel (total cholesterol / LDL / HDL / TG), CPK", "tag": "li" },
    { "zh": "絕對禁用閾值:ALC &lt; 500/μL、ANC &lt; 1000/μL、Hb &lt; 8 g/dL → 不可開始或須暫停", "en": "Absolute thresholds: ALC < 500/μL, ANC < 1000/μL, Hb < 8 g/dL → do not initiate or pause therapy", "tag": "li" },
    { "zh": "確認疫苗狀態：必要時補打；啟動後不可接種活性疫苗", "en": "Confirm vaccination status; supplement if needed. After initiation, live vaccines are contraindicated", "tag": "li" },
    { "zh": "追蹤期間：臨床注意上呼吸道感染、HSV 復發、痤瘡、CPK 上升、不明體重減輕", "en": "During follow-up: monitor for upper respiratory infection, HSV reactivation, acne, elevated CPK, and unexplained weight loss", "tag": "li" },
